WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:07.230
So your friend is an Ancient Dragon, I hear.

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:13.570
Not only that, but the two of you 
defeated a Dreadnought class Metaphysical.

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:15.360
Good job, Shizuno.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.530
An Urushibara woman indeed.

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:22.200
We're just friends. We aren't like that.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.330
Urushibara.

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:34.310
Come on, Urushibara.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.190
Are you all right, Shizuno?

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:38.130
Yes.

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:39.610
What were we talking about?

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:42.170
That Metaphysical.

00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:46.350
Why do you think the principal made a 
statement that the three of us defeated it?

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.680
Like this, and this...

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:02.690
The truth is, Nii-sama defeated it himself.

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:07.830
It's because you two held 
through that no one died.

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:09.610
The three of us defeated it.

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:14.760
But what you did was truly amazing.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.010
Was it?

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:18.650
I suppose.

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:23.350
Aside from you, only a Six Head 
could have done what you did.

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:24.720
A Six Head?

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:27.640
That's what they call the upper echelon 
of the White Knight Agency.

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:30.900
They're Rank S. There are only six 
of them in the entire world.

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:37.110
Welcome. Feel free to take a seat.

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:43.950
Are you ready to make an order?

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:46.830
Are you all right? Today is a great day.

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:49.700
Can I have a tea please? What do you have?

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:52.210
I, uh...

00:01:52.970 --> 00:01:55.670
Manager, help me, please.

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:57.960
May I help you?

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:02.810
Oh, I couldn't read the menu.

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:05.030
Oh, well then...

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:08.760
Wait, you can speak Japanese, 
so speak Japanese!

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:11.990
Maxwood Golden Chips tea leaves.

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:13.930
Heated to 61 degrees.

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:15.590
Have the milk sterilized at low temperature.

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:17.570
And Wasanbon sugar, please.

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:20.860
Go to Starmucks if you want that stuff!

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:25.820
Small Japanese cafés, like this one, 
don't handle complicated orders too well.

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:27.960
Oh, that's a shame.

00:02:28.470 --> 00:02:30.370
Are you here from Great Britain?

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:32.330
Hey, good guess.

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:36.460
I can understand your 
obsessiveness, then, I guess.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:41.470
Then again, the tea they serve in 
English cafés are mostly in tea bags.

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:44.330
Manager, bring me the thing!

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:51.560
It's the manager's best piece, 
based on tapioca milk tea.

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:54.250
Oh, it looks good.

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:57.570
And it's called natto milk tea!

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:01.660
What a waste.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:05.650
Dammit!

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:08.070
This is blasphemy against tea!

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:10.510
It's a declaration of war against my nation!

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:11.540
I'll go get a towel.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:14.790
Jeez, what a terrible cultural exchange.

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:18.900
Have you had any, Moroha-kun?

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:20.340
Me? Well...

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:24.580
<i>He's not there.</i>

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:34.610
<i>Time's stopped.</i>

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:37.650
<i>No, that's not it.</i>

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:41.140
<i>He's just too fast.</i>

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.790
Couldn't you move?

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:07.060
Or did you not want to move?

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:11.430
I would have been dead if 
you really meant to kill me.

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:15.180
You've let me down, then.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:20.780
Thank you.

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:25.280
What just happened?

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:26.540
White magic Hagun.

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:29.420
A secret move of Jinsoku secret moves.

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:30.670
You know about it?

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:32.870
He's one of the Six Heads.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:35.380
Head of the Great Britain headquarters.

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:37.330
Sir Edward Lampard.

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:13.350
Apparently that Edward person 
is here to visit Akane Academy.

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:16.370
He's probably really here for Moroha.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:22.190
Not just Britain. 
The US, China, France, Russia...

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:25.370
There's no doubt that every 
country is interested in Moroha.

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:28.370
He's my Nii-sama, after all.

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:31.780
Of course the Six Heads 
want to meet him in person.

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:37.040
I suppose.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:40.270
But how rude of him to pick 
a fight out of nowhere.

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:43.170
Nii-sama is a lot more than what he saw.

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:44.470
I suppose.

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:48.230
Yeah, Nii-sama is going to become 
a Rank S at light speed,

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:51.930
and he's going to do way more 
than the Six Heads ever can.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:53.910
Is that really the best thing?

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:58.700
Rank S is a nation's final weapon.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:01.190
They have no freedom.

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:04.690
They need permission just to take 
a walk, not to mention traveling.

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:09.110
On top of that, 
they're forced to fight against

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:11.950
fierce enemies that take huge 
groups of Rank As to defeat.

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:15.290
N-No way!

00:07:17.090 --> 00:07:20.860
How can I go on dates with Nii-sama, then?

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:25.710
I envy your sweet way you think.

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:35.680
Moroha-san.

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:38.740
You were...

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:40.310
Hey, it's you from before.

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:54.160
I can't let that slide.

00:07:54.510 --> 00:07:57.340
No, that was for medical purposes.

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:58.660
And you're...

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:00.720
Shimon Maya.

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:02.460
Call me Maya.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:04.670
M-Maya, huh?

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:05.540
Nice to meet you.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:09.460
You're not a student here, are you?

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:14.290
I awoke as a Savior, a lot 
sooner than most people.

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:16.080
I can't go to elementary school.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.970
That's why I'm here with Mari-oneechan.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.960
Mari-oneechan?

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:24.460
The principal. She's a relative.

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:25.540
Ah.

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:28.510
Shizuno, you knew Maya?

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:34.000
My older brother is the 
president of this school.

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:36.600
Tee-hee.

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:42.250
Since this is a joint class 
between first and second year,

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:45.540
let's have the second-years 
give us a demonstration.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:47.380
Yeah, I know, Tana T!

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:50.500
You want me to do it, don't you?

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:54.510
All right, first-years, 
you can call me Kamii!

00:08:57.910 --> 00:08:59.510
Bring it, Haimura.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:04.980
They set me aside to call you a super-rookie.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:07.760
I'll drag you across the coals.

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:11.780
How is he a member of the Strikers?

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:15.150
I'm embarrassed to be a second-year.

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:19.180
Moroha-san, good luck!

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:26.730
That's the Ancient Dragon 
that attends our school, sir.

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:30.170
Sir Edward.

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:31.730
Hm?

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:33.800
Why should I watch?

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:36.330
Let's do this, Haimura!

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:42.210
<b>There exists purgatory in the netherworld and 
fields of fire in the corporeal world.</b>

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:45.220
<b>Fire discriminates not against good nor evil 
as it burns and purifies with ferocious mercy.</b>

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:44.210
Mannendo-kun!

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:45.230
That's a Step Two...

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:47.810
Blaze!

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:51.900
Nii-sama!

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:55.240
Burn well!

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:03.270
He stopped a Step Two with an Anti-Magic!

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:04.660
Just how much Plana does he have?

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:06.660
Nice, Haimura.

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:11.280
Haimura! Why don't you feel the burn 
a little more? Suffer a little!

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:15.650
This is Nii-sama's true strength!

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:17.680
Such no!

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:20.180
See?

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:22.920
<b>There exists purgatory in the netherworld and 
fields of fire in the corporeal world.</b>

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:22.930
My turn now, Kamii-senpai.

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:27.260
<b>Fire discriminates not against good nor evil 
as it burns and purifies with ferocious mercy.</b>

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:26.890
Step Three is cheating!

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.350
No fair, Haimura!

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:31.650
<b>All things must return to skull and bones. 
Let the cremation begin.</b>

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.650
I'm sorry! I was kidding! Forgive me!

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:35.080
Here we go, Senpai.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:36.340
Incinerate.

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:43.510
Such no!

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:46.330
<b>Principal's Office</b>

00:10:49.010 --> 00:10:51.940
Welcome to the principal's office.

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:56.650
Um... Is the principal not back yet?

00:10:57.310 --> 00:10:59.450
You can wait here.

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:13.190
Are you here to hear about 
Shizuno-oneesan and the president?

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:15.560
Yeah, actually.

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:18.740
I can tell you what I know.

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:25.210
Mari-oneechan is with Sir whats-his-face. 
She won't be back for a while.

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:26.570
You tricked me.

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:30.000
I never said she's coming back.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:35.670
The Urushibara family is huge.

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:39.700
Shizuno-oneesan's grandpa was 
this school's capital investor.

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:43.020
The president is also an executive 
 of the Japan branch.

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:48.500
He wants to make Shizuno-oneesan an executive, 
so he can become even greater.

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:53.020
That's why he's been training Shizuno-oneesan 
as a Dark Mage since before she entered school.

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:54.900
And he nominated her for the Strikers.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:59.620
He treats his own sister like a tool.

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:02.030
That's right.

00:12:02.810 --> 00:12:08.270
But she's been happier since 
she met you, Moroha-san.

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:11.370
Mari-oneechan and I are happy, too.

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:15.960
You're one of the people who defeated 
that Metaphysical, aren't you?

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:18.840
I envy the Japan branch.

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:22.260
We don't have too many able 
Dark Mages at headquarters.

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:27.530
It's because of the Ancient Dragon that 
my sister was able to come back alive.

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:32.760
I hear Haimura-kun defied orders 
to come to Shizuno's aid.

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:39.970
That's true, but Shizuno-san 
is truly talented.

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:39.970
<i>I wish we'd get hit by an 
asteroid or something right now.</i>

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:23.110
It's cold.

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:26.060
Another nation falls.

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:30.200
Because you used the forbidden spell.

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:32.250
It's a frozen hell.

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:38.080
Not a single blade of grass 
will grow here ever again.

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:43.210
An act befitting Pluto, Shu Saura.

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:47.620
Do you fear me, witch of the netherworld?

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:56.500
<i>That was my other past life.</i>

00:13:57.610 --> 00:14:00.520
<i>That felt rather convincing to be a dream.</i>

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:03.780
It was, like, soft.

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:08.740
What are you doing, Shizuno?

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:12.370
I'm having my boobs groped.

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:14.370
I'm sorry.

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:20.860
What?

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:23.920
Are you a witch of the netherworld?

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:28.990
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:37.060
Do it.

00:14:37.420 --> 00:14:38.370
What?

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:40.140
What are you thinking?

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:42.260
I had a feeling you were going to kiss me.

00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:44.360
Stop messing with me already.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:47.070
Yeah? Oh? Ah.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:49.060
I was wondering where you'd gone.

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:51.570
You were flirting behind 
your own sister's back!

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:54.700
How much did you hear?

00:14:55.140 --> 00:14:58.330
From "I had a feeling you 
were going to kiss me!"

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.140
Nii-sama, you kiss freak!

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:02.330
You womanizer!

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:02.330
Look out! Look out!

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:05.740
According to Principal Shimon's report,

00:15:05.740 --> 00:15:08.530
the Metaphysical was 
defeated by three people.

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:10.800
No visual records.

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:14.320
That sounds suspicious.

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:16.680
It seems that President Urushibara is

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:19.940
becoming frustrated because 
you won't agree, sir.

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.330
Tadanori can wait.

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:25.690
I'll only give an answer after 
I've seen Moroha's true ability.

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:31.320
But if you do any more, you'll cause 
an international diplomatic issue.

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:33.950
You're right.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.410
Oh yeah, about dinner tonight.

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:39.160
I've rented out a well-established 
sushi restaurant.

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:44.530
I was hoping we could take it easy tonight.

00:15:44.530 --> 00:15:45.670
Cancel that, please.

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:53.520
E-Excuse me.

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:56.260
Cancel it?

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:56.810
Yeah.

00:15:59.590 --> 00:16:01.190
Take-out, please.

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:05.040
Yes, my lord.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:18.260
Haimura Moroha-sama is 
waiting in the dining hall.

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:19.500
I see.

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:39.430
Hey. I was waiting for you, Shizuno.

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:41.430
Moroha.

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:45.710
Is this your doing, Nii-san?

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:48.930
You could smile, you know.

00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:50.270
You look good.

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:52.350
You don't have to be embarrassed, Moroha.

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:54.280
Yeah?

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:56.160
You look good in that, too, Shizuno.

00:16:57.680 --> 00:17:01.230
This is the first time I've 
seen you in regular clothes.

00:17:02.030 --> 00:17:03.180
Yeah?

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:05.370
Thanks.

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:12.570
Sorry to call you out on such 
short notice, Haimura-kun.

00:17:12.570 --> 00:17:15.590
It's fine. This is delicious.

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:19.450
I hear you're good friends with my sister.

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:21.100
Is she being of any help?

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:23.550
Help?

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:25.740
Well, she's being good to me.

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:31.310
You will continue to work hard so 
that you can be by Haimura-kun.

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:32.250
Got it?

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:34.280
Understood, Nii-san.

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:38.270
Now, Haimura-kun.

00:17:38.270 --> 00:17:42.030
Do you know what the condition 
is to become a certified Rank S?

00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:43.710
No, I don't.

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:51.380
To defeat a Metaphysical on your own that 
can't normally be defeated one-on-one.

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:55.660
That's you, Haimura-kun.

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:59.350
If you're talking about that Metaphysical, 
the three of us defeated it.

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:07.520
If the two others agree, 
you'll be certified Rank S, won't you?

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:14.390
A simple lie can make you the Number 
Two man of the Japan branch.

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:17.030
You'd have all the fame and 
fortune you could desire.

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:21.990
There'd be no better way to 
repay your aunt and uncle.

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:25.050
Stop it, Nii-san.

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:28.470
If he becomes a Rank S, Moroha 
won't have any more freedom.

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:31.840
Shizuno, this is the family's decision.

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:44.810
I'm sorry my brother is so selfish.

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:47.810
I'm fine.

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:51.810
It's kind of a lonely room.

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:53.980
What makes you say that?

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:59.770
I can't really picture your face here.

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:01.340
I suppose.

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:04.770
There's nothing in this room 
that I chose for myself.

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:10.960
Urushibaras aren't allowed 
to have their own interests.

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:18.340
But now I'm interested in sleeping.

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:23.250
Because I can dwell in 
happiness in my dreams.

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:24.910
Of course, it's different 
when I'm with you, Moroha.

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:28.920
I've never fallen asleep when 
I'm with you, have I, Moroha?

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:32.080
You did tease me, 
pretending to be asleep, though.

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:35.560
This is getting lame.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:37.340
Let's go get some fresh air.

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:47.220
It's cold.

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:52.600
Should we go inside?

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:56.330
No.

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:58.230
It's depressing.

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:00.660
I want to feel the night air.

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:24.660
Are you really good here?

00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:27.730
Yes, I want to get some 
fresh air before I go home.

00:21:28.190 --> 00:21:29.830
Understood.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:31.470
Have this.

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:34.480
<b></b>Superb Ham
Delicious Taste
<b>Myougyoku</b>

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:34.480
Please eat it soon.

00:21:35.650 --> 00:21:36.980
Thank you!

00:21:42.850 --> 00:21:45.220
There's enough for three days.

00:21:49.560 --> 00:21:50.780
Come out.

00:21:52.550 --> 00:21:55.760
I don't know who you are and I 
don't intend to ask what you want.

00:21:56.450 --> 00:22:00.490
I don't intend to chase you down 
if you'll end this peacefully.

00:22:23.720 --> 00:22:24.730
Such a waste!

00:22:31.940 --> 00:22:33.740
Come, Saratiga!

00:22:54.860 --> 00:22:55.910
Dammit!

00:22:56.650 --> 00:22:57.890
You're a woman?

00:22:58.400 --> 00:23:03.150
I'll prove to you that you're 
not fit to trouble that person.

00:23:17.860 --> 00:23:19.520
This is the end!

00:23:31.530 --> 00:23:33.260
I remember.

00:23:34.350 --> 00:23:37.850
<b>Shapeless blade, invisible sword. Show yourself, shredder!</b>

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:39.310
Breeze Blade!

00:23:59.710 --> 00:24:04.690
<i>None of us noticed the ominous 
way the stars twinkled.</i>

00:24:05.970 --> 00:24:08.730
<i>The omens of what Sir 
Edward's true goals were,</i>

00:24:08.730 --> 00:24:12.520
<i>and of what was about to 
happen to Shizuno-san.</i>

00:24:14.890 --> 00:24:24.770
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:15.540 --> 00:24:18.170
My lord, I've ordered sushi take-out.

00:24:18.170 --> 00:24:19.540
Oh, sounds delicious!

00:24:19.540 --> 00:24:20.410
Natto rolls.

00:24:20.410 --> 00:24:21.090
Boo!

00:24:21.090 --> 00:24:22.900
Next time, "White Knight's Fierce Attack."

00:24:22.900 --> 00:24:24.980
Come, Saratiga!
